{
 "duration": 24.612,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Emma loved a waterfall trail she hiked last spring.",
   "start": 0.3,
   "end": 3.3
  },
  {
   "text": "She went back in November and the steps were icy, the falls half dry.",
   "start": 3.5,
   "end": 7.478
  },
  {
   "text": "She'd forgotten what it was like, and when.",
   "start": 7.728,
   "end": 9.894
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the fix. After every hike, write down the date, the weather and the trail conditions, not just the name.",
   "start": 10.394,
   "end": 16.952
  },
  {
   "text": "Next time you'll know the best month to go.",
   "start": 17.202,
   "end": 19.354
  },
  {
   "text": "Now Emma plans her hikes from her own notes.",
   "start": 19.854,
   "end": 22.225
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this before your next hike.",
   "start": 22.725,
   "end": 24.412
  }
 ],
